{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"710597","name":"Omnia Pagrati Apartments","description":"Ideally located in the vibrant Pagrati area, Omnia Pagrati Apartments promises a relaxing and memorable stay in Athens. The property offers a high standard of service along with a wide range of amenities designed to meet the individual needs of every traveller. Guests can enjoy facilities such as Wi-Fi in all rooms, private check-in/check-out, transfer services, a fully equipped kitchen, and luggage storage during office hours. Each apartment is thoughtfully designed for comfort, featuring amenities such as a wardrobe, eco friendly bath amenities, fresh towels and linen and a flat-screen television to ensure a restful stay. The surrounding area offers various recreational opportunities, allowing guests to fully experience the charm of Athens. Omnia Pagrati Apartments combines warm hospitality with a welcoming atmosphere, making your visit truly unforgettable. Housekeeping is provided every three days, with additional services available upon request for your convenience. Breakfast is delivered to your door daily in specially prepared packaging, between 07:00–08:00. Kindly note that it is essential for guests to contact us in advance prior to their arrival and inform us regarding their arrival time, as our reception operates during specific hours: Monday to Friday 09:00–22:00 and weekends 11:00–19:00. Check-in is available until 12:00 AM (midnight). If guests are expected to arrive after midnight, we strongly recommend that they arrange a transfer service so the driver can hand over the keys upon arrival. In such cases, it is mandatory that we receive the guests' contact details in advance.","address":"Chremonidou 30, 30","city":"Pagrati","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"116 33","lat":37.9658183,"lng":23.7498529,"giataCode":"987139","phone":"+302107001426","email":"info@omnia-pagrati.com","website":"omnia-pagrati.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata